<description>&lt;p&gt;Algerian soldiers have entered Niger to protect energy assets as jihadist attacks intensify, and the Niger NSCDC detention centre saw 14 children die among 33 detainees from overcrowding and asphyxiation. Russian-affiliated forces continue killing civilians in Mali, while Burkina Faso is pushing for youth training at a Russia-Africa summit. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE5UZzhsRVp5VU9hb05MbmF6TVNiSkc4aHhBNlJobTVqTVdUMmZLc2RMaDVoZS1vT2QzM0xsMW5EcWIzWUlNVnRWNzNpNkJwZFNGLU1V?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheStar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxONE1KMlZQV3RnOE5UMlN5eXVrU2c1SlNiUlpRQktvcG9hR2dzR3VUdC02T25uQld3V3RjQlFZdTVrbHhRVzhzckROXzhucHRocEtYcXJndXdGUmt5VzBjUmVxTVRSOG5WQm5xa1NrMmc4OEt6ZVpzSEpWT3dDV2JYVHMxR1BFdWJNc19EWTJNeHZ6NDVfazZNemRSU2t4TnVfYmIyZ3AyNVI5Y09E?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPQnhKck5ZZE5iNHNUR1oyS3BsTkdQRGx3dHVUeXZzbnVuRjZ1T2ktQzVRSk9rbS1YZjByM3dnd3dwdlAtQmE0WWFpRjhpTVg1M01CWUVZWDhmeExLWjBJUmc4QzBLc3QyS2pZSEtEdzlaV05FUlI1cDlaWXVQRURmOW53ZzVUdnAtejdEWW9PUXViZEd2MWFoaUpDbURnQmdYdHNvQTdQZWpRbkRNS0I2TFdwYTdlN0ZfTHlqcUhSdmtTVzdsQlBuQ2lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPMTBvNkQ5Q0xEUnlCcEFNVGRXUzFSbUF4ZGFveGJQYWtiVTRUVWtJOG0tbUhHWHpKcVJXSWRkdHdzMzZERExqRVByY0JYUHBQN1ByQlRNUkxZZWd4MlRQV3ZDU1lpX0ZfYXcxM0V1ay1mejJrTjZlLThITWhPRUVNUjR3amV2Q3dQUE5QaTFZOV9XTlFzQ2hrRkFMQWkweEgtS0M5cTc0Y29TTEU4cmNhTDE2RHBmME5F?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPVU5